  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An elliptical loop having resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>, of semi major axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> , and semi minor axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> &nbsp;is placed in a magnetic field as shown in the figure. If the loop is rotated about the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis with angular frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>, the average power loss in the loop due to Joule heating is :</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0244_8f7b3ec2800c.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 136px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "zero",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>bB</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math>",
